  "id": "5e13e6a8-d9ef-4886-93b8-095c24c85847",
  "title": "Unified 3D Object Detection Framework",
  "summary": "The paper introduces a stereo 4D radar-based 3D object detection framework that combines geometric alignment with absolute velocity estimation, improving performance in 3D object detection. This approach addresses the challenges of sparse and noisy radar data by leveraging stereo geometry and Doppler motion information.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "PART (Physics-Aware Radar Transformer) achieves a class-agnostic average precision (CA-AP) of 0.8827 with only 1.1 million parameters.",
      "confidence": 0.95
