    {
      "statement": "The framework reduces mean average surface translation error (mASTE) and mean average velocity error (mAVE) to 0.3188 m and 0.8084 m/s respectively.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The results demonstrate significant improvements in 3D object detection (8.82 points in AP 3D) compared to state-of-the-art mono 4D baselines.",
      "confidence": 0.95
